  "conclusion": "The original/native effective-radius estimate selects collider modes; it is not itself a physical swallow gate. The verification planner combines it with an enlarged rotated render box when a pooled body is absent. This rejects the four distant Trumpets before floor or bomb checks, while the same meshes with active actual collider bounds pass. It is a concrete selection/activation circular-dependency risk consistent with active=0 and target=none in the failure trace. The authorized fallback now skips this size estimate only after ordinary candidates are exhausted, retaining arena/bomb checks and requiring actual physical collection.",
